  "title": {
    "rendered": "Internet Broadband Fact Labels"
  },
  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\n\t<p>LymeFiber delivers fiber broadband internet to residents in Lyme, New Hampshire. The following Broadband Facts labels are designed to provide clear, easy-to understand, and accurate information about the cost, value, and features included in our Residential fiber broadband products.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.lymefiber.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/broadband-facts-labels-2026-03-20-5-51-PM.csv\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Machine Readable Labels</a></p>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494R0100MB20250716\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tResidential Basic\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494R0300MB20250716\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tResidential Standard\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494R1000MB20250717\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tResidential Wicked\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494OZUA1PBHD1PLQSC\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tResidential Rural Wicked\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494B0100MB20250716\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBusiness Basic\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494B0300MB20250716\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBusiness Standard\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494B0500MB20250716\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBusiness Ultra\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://order.lymefiber.net/broadband-facts/F0029062494B1000MB20250716\"  target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"    rel=\"noopener\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\tBusiness Wicked\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\n",
    "protected": false
  },
  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "<p>LymeFiber delivers fiber broadband internet to residents in Lyme, New Hampshire. The following Broadband Facts labels are designed to provide clear, easy-to understand, and accurate information about the cost, value, and features included in our Residential fiber broadband products. Machine Readable Labels Residential Basic Residential Standard Residential Wicked Residential Rural Wicked Business Basic Business Standard [&hellip;]</p>\n",
    "protected": false
  },
